    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_Room Availability Management API",
    "description": "The Room Availability Management API enables users to check and manage the availability of hotel rooms efficiently. Through this API, travelers and hotels can interact to determine room availability and initiate booking processes based on real-time data. Typical consumers include online travel agencies, hotel management systems, and travel apps seeking to provide up-to-date room information. This API facilitates a seamless experience in the hospitality sector, streamlining operations from availability checks to reservation management.",
